<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <style>
    body { font: 14px/1.6 -apple-system, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0 16px; color: #1f2329; }
    h1 { font-size: 18px; }
    label { display: block; margin: 16px 0 6px; font-weight: 600; }
    input[type=text], input[type=number] { width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #dcdfe6; border-radius: 6px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; }
    .hint { color: #8a9099; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .chk { margin: 16px 0; }
    button { margin-top: 20px; padding: 9px 20px; border: 0; background: #1456f0; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; }
    #saved { color: #16a34a; margin-left: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Temu 店铺监测 · 设置</h1>
  <label>飞书机器人 Webhook</label>
  <input type="text" id="webhook" placeholder="https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxxxxxxx" />
  <div class="hint">在你自己的飞书群里添加「自定义机器人」，把它的 Webhook 地址粘到这里。每人填自己的群。</div>

  <label>检查间隔（分钟）</label>
  <input type="number" id="interval" min="1" value="15" />
  <div class="hint">插件会每隔这么久自动刷新一次后台商品页并检查（需保持 Chrome 开着、Temu 已登录）。</div>

  <div class="chk"><label style="display:inline;font-weight:400;"><input type="checkbox" id="enabled" /> 启用监测告警</label></div>

  <button id="save">保存</button><span id="saved"></span>

  <script src="options.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
